      "value": "Is the screen the webpanel itself or a duplicate material?\nI've noticed duplicate materials sometimes go white and rejoining the world is required.\n\n(If it's not your world at the moment you can tell the difference by the always-on-top bug)\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/webpanels-always-on-top",
